{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.\u00a0This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.poster.avif?t=1759853038\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.webm?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.mp4?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is watching you. Something is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the dead of night, you find yourself sent on a simple errand\u2014to check on a quiet gas station on the outskirts of town. But nothing here <strong>feels right</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air is heavy with something unspoken, the radio crackles with words that don't belong, and the station itself... <strong>shifts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward drags you deeper into a <strong>nightmare of fractured reality and unseen terrors</strong>. Strange voices whisper in your ear, shadows stretch and writhe, and <strong>the choices you make will carve your fate</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you listen? Will you obey? Or will you resist, knowing that every decision carries a price?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.poster.avif?t=1759853038\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.webm?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.mp4?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Experience a slow-burning descent into paranoia, dread, and disturbing imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make alters the experience, shaping the horrors that unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 A haunting handcrafted world brought to life with eerie animations and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A chilling original soundtrack and unnerving ambient sounds that react to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your fate is not set. Discover different outcomes depending on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short horror experience crafted by a solo developer</strong> - roughly 30mins of finely tuned tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.poster.avif?t=1759853038\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.webm?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.mp4?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn't a place you can escape by running. Something <i>wants</i> you here. And it <i>will</i> make sure you stay.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489460?t=1759853038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759853038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/0df00140d2ea4df467d947cbdd1fe63cb5c851a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759853038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/0df00140d2ea4df467d947cbdd1fe63cb5c851a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759853038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains themes and depictions that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players will encounter:\r\n\r\n-Psychological horror elements, including intense and unsettling scenarios.\r\n-Depictions of violence and references to death, presented in a pixel art style.\r\n-Disturbing dialogue and scenarios involving coercion, threats, and psychological manipulation.\r\n-Themes of self-harm, suicide, and sacrifice, presented as part of the narrative choices.\r\n-Mild references to alcohol usage in dialogue or environmental storytelling.\r\n-Please note that while these elements are integral to the storytelling and atmosphere, they are handled with care to serve the narrative and are not gratuitous. \r\n\r\nPlayers sensitive to these topics are advised to proceed with caution."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.\u00a0This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.poster.avif?t=1759853038\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.webm?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.mp4?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is watching you. Something is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the dead of night, you find yourself sent on a simple errand\u2014to check on a quiet gas station on the outskirts of town. But nothing here <strong>feels right</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air is heavy with something unspoken, the radio crackles with words that don't belong, and the station itself... <strong>shifts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward drags you deeper into a <strong>nightmare of fractured reality and unseen terrors</strong>. Strange voices whisper in your ear, shadows stretch and writhe, and <strong>the choices you make will carve your fate</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you listen? Will you obey? Or will you resist, knowing that every decision carries a price?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.poster.avif?t=1759853038\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.webm?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.mp4?t=1759853038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Experience a slow-burning descent into paranoia, dread, and disturbing imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make alters the experience, shaping the horrors that unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 A haunting handcrafted world brought to life with eerie animations and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A chilling original soundtrack and unnerving ambient sounds that react to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your fate is not set. Discover different outcomes depending on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short horror experience crafted by a solo dev